<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>API</title>

    <!-- Fontes e ícones -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/phosphor-icons/2.1.1/css/phosphor-bold.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #151515;
            --surface: #1e1e1e;
            --border: #2e3134;
            --text: #f0f0f0;
            --text-muted: #8a8a8a;
            --accent: #ff0101;
            --accent-hover: #cc0000;
            --code-bg: #0d0d0d;
            --card-radius: 16px;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .api-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .api-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .api-header .logo {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .api-header h1 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .api-header .version {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 4px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-left: auto;
        }

        .api-description {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
            padding-left: 18px;
        }

        .api-card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--card-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .api-card-header {
            padding: 18px 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        }

        .api-card-header i {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .api-card-header h2 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .api-card-body {
            padding: 8px 0;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .endpoint-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .endpoint-table th {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .endpoint-table td {
            padding: 14px 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .endpoint-table tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .method {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 2px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .method.get { background: #0d6efd; color: #fff; }
        .method.post { background: #198754; color: #fff; }
        .method.put { background: #fd7e14; color: #fff; }
        .method.patch { background: #6f42c1; color: #fff; }
        .method.delete { background: #dc3545; color: #fff; }

        .endpoint-path {
            font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #e0e0e0;
        }

        .endpoint-desc {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .auth-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 2px 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .auth-badge.required {
            color: var(--accent);
            border-color: var(--accent);
            background: rgba(255, 1, 1, 0.08);
        }

        .auth-badge.csrf {
            color: #ffc107;
            border-color: #ffc107;
            background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.08);
        }

        .api-footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .api-footer a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .api-footer a:hover {
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .base-url {
            background: var(--code-bg);
            padding: 4px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #b0b0b0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .api-header {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
            .api-header .version {
                margin-left: 0;
            }
            .endpoint-table th,
            .endpoint-table td {
                padding: 10px 14px;
                font-size: 0.8rem;
            }
            .endpoint-path {
                font-size: 0.75rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 12px;
            }
            .api-card-header {
                padding: 14px 16px;
            }
            .endpoint-table th,
            .endpoint-table td {
                padding: 8px 10px;
                font-size: 0.7rem;
            }
        }

        /* scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            height: 4px;
            width: 4px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: transparent;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: var(--border);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="api-container">
        <!-- Cabeçalho -->
        <header class="api-header">
            <div class="logo">
                <img src="/images/side-bar-logo.png" alt="AnalisAI" style="height:40px; filter: brightness(0) invert(8.24%);">
            </div>
            <h1>AnalisAI <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--text-muted);">API</span></h1>
            <span class="version"><i class="ph-bold ph-code"></i> v1.0.0</span>
        </header>

        <div class="api-description">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-info" style="color:var(--accent);margin-right:8px;"></i>
            API REST da plataforma de gestão pedagógica AnalisAI.
            Todas as rotas mutáveis (POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE) exigem token CSRF no cabeçalho <code>X-CSRF-Token</code>.
            A maioria dos endpoints requer autenticação via sessão.
        </div>

        <!-- Base URL -->
        <div style="margin-bottom:24px;">
            <span class="base-url">
                <i class="ph-bold ph-link"></i> Base URL: <span id="baseUrlDisplay"><%= baseUrl %></span>
            </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Tabela de Endpoints -->
        <div class="api-card">
            <div class="api-card-header">
                <i class="ph-bold ph-list"></i>
                <h2>Endpoints Disponíveis</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="api-card-body">
                <table class="endpoint-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th style="width:80px;">Método</th>
                            <th style="min-width:160px;">Endpoint</th>
                            <th>Descrição</th>
                            <th style="width:120px;">Autenticação</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <!-- HOME -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Lista de endpoints (esta página)</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge">Público</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- CONTA -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/conta</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Dados da conta do usuário logado</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- NOTIFICAÇÕES -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/notificacoes</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Lista de notificações não lidas</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/notificacoes/marcar-lida/:id</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Marcar uma notificação como lida</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão + CSRF</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/notificacoes/marcar-todas-lidas</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Marcar todas as notificações como lidas</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão + CSRF</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- CONFIGURAÇÕES NOTIFICAÇÕES -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/configuracoes-notificacoes</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Obter configurações de notificações</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/configuracoes-notificacoes</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Salvar configurações de notificações</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão + CSRF</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- TAREFAS STATS -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/tarefas-stats</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Estatísticas de tarefas (professores)</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão (Professor)</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- ALUNO GRÁFICOS -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/aluno/dados-grafico</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Dados para gráficos do aluno</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão (Aluno)</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/aluno/ranking-comparativo</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Ranking comparativo do aluno</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão (Aluno)</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- BUSCA ALUNOS -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/alunos/busca</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Buscar alunos (professores)</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão (Professor)</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- HEALTH -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/health</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Verificação de saúde do sistema</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge">Público</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- IA HISTÓRICO -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/ia/historico</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Histórico de conversas da IA</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method patch">PATCH</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/ia/historico/:id</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Atualizar conversa (apagar, fixar, renomear)</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão + CSRF</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- IA CHAT -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/ia/aluno/chat</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Chat do aluno com a IA</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão (Aluno) + CSRF</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/ia/professor/chat</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Chat do professor com a IA</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão (Professor) + CSRF</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/ia/professor/aluno/:id/analisar</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Analisar aluno via IA</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão (Professor) + CSRF</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method post">POST</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/ia/professor/alterar-nota</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Alterar nota via IA (com confirmação)</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão (Professor) + CSRF</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <!-- CSRF TOKEN -->
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="method get">GET</span></td>
                            <td><code class="endpoint-path">/csrf-token</code></td>
                            <td class="endpoint-desc">Obter token CSRF</td>
                            <td><span class="auth-badge">Sessão (opcional)</span></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Legenda de autenticação -->
        <div class="api-card" style="margin-top:12px;">
            <div class="api-card-header">
                <i class="ph-bold ph-shield-check"></i>
                <h2>Autenticação e Segurança</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="api-card-body" style="padding:18px 24px;">
                <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;font-size:0.9rem;">
                    <div><span class="auth-badge" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">Público</span> – sem autenticação</div>
                    <div><span class="auth-badge required">Sessão</span> – requer login via cookie de sessão</div>
                    <div><span class="auth-badge csrf" style="color:#ffc107;border-color:#ffc107;background:rgba(255,193,7,0.08);">CSRF</span> – token CSRF obrigatório no header <code>X-CSRF-Token</code></div>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top:16px;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.85rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:14px;">
                    <strong>Como obter o token CSRF:</strong> Faça uma requisição <code>GET /api/csrf-token</code> e use o valor retornado no campo <code>csrfToken</code>.
                    <br>
                    <strong>Exemplo de requisição com CSRF:</strong>
                    <pre style="background:var(--code-bg);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:0.8rem;color:#ccc;overflow-x:auto;">
fetch('/api/ia/professor/chat', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
        'Content-Type': 'application/json',
        'X-CSRF-Token': token
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({ message: 'Olá' })
})</pre>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Rodapé -->
        <footer class="api-footer">
            <span>© 2026 <a href="/">AnalisAI</a></span>
            <span>
                <a href="/dashboard" target="_blank"><i class="ph-bold ph-house"></i> Dashboard</a>
                <span style="margin:0 8px;">•</span>
                <a href="/manuais" target="_blank"><i class="ph-bold ph-book"></i> Manuais</a>
            </span>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Exibir a base URL dinamicamente
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
            const baseUrl = window.location.origin + '/api';
            document.getElementById('baseUrlDisplay').textContent = baseUrl;
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>